      "body": "Narrative update on Aurobindo Pharma The analyst fair value estimate for Aurobindo Pharma has moved slightly higher to about ₹1,380 from roughly ₹1,366, with analysts citing small adjustments to revenue expectations, a modestly higher profit margin assumption near 23.3%, and a slightly lower future P/E input as the key drivers of this change. Analyst Commentary Recent Street research on other global equities highlights how analysts are adjusting models, price targets, and ratings in response to changes in growth assumptions, cash flow, and perceived execution risks.",
